{"created": "2026-09-10T14:36:49.769301+00:00", "modified": "2026-09-11T08:14:28.463955+00:00", "id": 22692726, "conceptrecid": "22692725", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.22692726", "conceptdoi": "10.5281/zenodo.22692725", "doi_url": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.22692726", "metadata": {"title": "DARPA SUBOFF AFF-8 Submarine: RANS Resistance and Actuator-Disk Self-Propulsion Simulations with code_saturne 9.1", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.22692726", "publication_date": "2026-09-10", "description": "<p>Steady RANS (k-&omega; SST) setup and results for the DARPA SUBOFF AFF-8 submarine configuration (bare hull + sail + four cruciform stern appendages), computed with code_saturne v9.1 on a half-model mesh (459,209 cells, symmetry plane, wall functions). Two cases: (1) a towed resistance sweep at 6 speeds (5.93-17.79 kn) validated against the DTMB tow-tank campaign (Liu &amp; Huang 1998), -0.1% to -3.7% on total resistance; (2) a milestone-1 self-propulsion study using a thrust-only Hough-Ordway actuator disk at the propeller plane (radii adapted from the INSEAN E1619 propeller) with an in-run controller converging to the self-propulsion point, matching a published fully meshed rotating-blade CFD result (Guo et al. 2023) to under 1% on thrust. Includes case definitions (setup.xml, user-function source terms and force/thrust post-processing), per-iteration forces/residuals/timings, full-field EnSight Gold output (volume and boundary), the mesh (derived from the public BARAM SUBOFF tutorial), and the digitised experimental reference data used for validation. See README.md for conventions, headline results and the pinned Docker command reproducing the runs.</p>", "access_right": "open", "creators": [{"name": "simvia", "affiliation": null}], "keywords": ["DARPA SUBOFF", "submarine hydrodynamics", "naval hydrodynamics", "code_saturne", "RANS", "k-omega SST", "CFD", "self-propulsion", "actuator disk", "E1619 propeller", "resistance prediction"], "related_identifiers": [{"identifier": "10.3390/jmse11061206", "relation": "references", "resource_type": "publication-article", "scheme": "doi"}, {"identifier": "https://apps.dtic.mil/sti/citations/ADA359226", "relation": "references", "resource_type": "publication-report", "scheme": "url"}, {"identifier": "https://apps.dtic.mil/sti/citations/ADA329405", "relation": "references", "resource_type": "publication-report", "scheme": "url"}, {"identifier": "https://apps.dtic.mil/sti/citations/ADA218797", "relation": "references", "resource_type": "publication-report", "scheme": "url"}, {"identifier": "https://www.code-saturne.org", "relation": "requires", "resource_type": "software", "scheme": "url"}, {"identifier": "https://simvia.tech/en/blog/code-saturne-naval-hydrodynamics-darpa-suboff", "relation": "isSupplementTo", "resource_type": "other", "scheme": "url"}], "version": "1.0", "language": "eng", "resource_type": {"title": "Dataset", "type": "dataset"}, "license": {"id": "cc-by-4.0"}, "communities": [{"id": "simvia"}], "relations": {"version": [{"index": 0, "is_last": true, "parent": {"pid_type": "recid", "pid_value": "22692725"}}]}}, "title": "DARPA SUBOFF AFF-8 Submarine: RANS Resistance and Actuator-Disk Self-Propulsion Simulations with code_saturne 9.1", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22692726", "self_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/22692726", "preview_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/22692726?preview=1", "doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.22692726", "self_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.22692726", "self_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.22692726", "reserve_doi": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22692726/draft/pids/doi", "parent": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22692725", "parent_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/22692725", "parent_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.22692725", "parent_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.22692725", "self_iiif_manifest": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:22692726/manifest", "self_iiif_sequence": "https:/